 "notes": [
  "Game values: one headless AI-only 1.2.0 game (DLC on) from the 1836 bookmark, logged to December 1905 (runs/windows_120/campaign), cut into the windows.",
  "The game values cover the 40 largest economies in each window's first month. game_se is the spread across those countries over the square root of their count. Countries in one game share a world, so it understates run-to-run noise.",
  "The tuner values come from 1000 economies of the AI preset (engine.defaults(), bot ai, seed 1), run from 1836 and cut into the same months.",
  "A panic already running in a window's first month does not count as one of that window's panics, on both sides.",
  "Lending counts as frozen in a month when Bad Debts are at or above the stop line (spec_crunch_lend at 0), read from the logged crunch and lax."
 ],
